:PNLGRP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP NAME='ANZDLT'.Analize Deleted Records in a Library - Help
:P.This command produces an excel file with infomraiton about
files/tables with deleted records. It is intended to assist in cleaning
up the files to save storage and decrease unneeded resource usage.
:P.The command can take a while to finish, so it is suggested to submit
it to batch. It ios also suggested that it be run outside of primary
usage hours so it does not slow the system down at peak times.
:p.The command runs for one library and emails the results as an
excel file the email address entered on the command.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP NAME='ANZDLT/LIB'.Library (LIB) - Help
:XH3.Library (LIB)
:P.Specifies the anme of the library to analyze.
:P.This is a required parameter.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP NAME='ANZDLT/EMAILTO'.Email to Address (EMAILTO) - Help
:XH3.Email to Address (EMAILTO)
:P.Specifies the address to email the results to.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP NAME='ANZDLT/REORG'.Reorganize Files (REORG) - Help
:XH3.Reorganize Files (REORG)
:P.Allows member with deleted records to be reorganized.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:EPNLGRP.
